| Session event | <code>urn:ax:schema:session-event</code> | <code>1.0.0</code>, <code>2.0.0</code> for clone lifecycle, <code>3.0.0</code> for adoption and move lifecycle, <code>4.0.0</code> for Terminal Instance bindings |
